  "definitieNl": "<span class=\"dl-sense dl-d0\"> <span class=\"dl-gram\"><abbr title=\"Substantivum\">znw.</abbr></span>, <span class=\"dl-gram\">m.</span> et <span class=\"dl-gram\">fem.</span>, <span class=\"dl-lbl\">Pl.</span> <gez>በረከታት፡</gez> <i class=\"dl-tr\">zegening</i> <span class=\"dl-sense dl-d1\"><b class=\"dl-n\">1</b> <i class=\"dl-tr\">lofprijzing</i>, <i class=\"dl-tr\">verheerlijking</i>: <gez>አዕበይዎ፡</gez> (<gez>ለእግዚአብሔር፡</gez>) <gez>በኵሉ፡ በረከት፡ ወስብሐት፡</gez> <a class=\"lex-reflink\" data-ref=\"nehemia 9:5\" target=\"_top\" href=\"index.html#nehemia/9/5\">Neh. 9,5</a>; <a class=\"lex-reflink\" data-ref=\"openbaring 5:12\" target=\"_top\" href=\"index.html#openbaring/5/12\">Apoc. 5,12</a>; <a class=\"lex-reflink\" data-ref=\"openbaring 5:13\" target=\"_top\" href=\"index.html#openbaring/5/13\">Apoc. 5,13</a>; <a class=\"lex-reflink\" data-ref=\"henoch 39:7\" target=\"_top\" href=\"index.html#henoch/39/7\">Hen. 39,7</a>; <a class=\"lex-reflink\" data-ref=\"henoch 39:9\" target=\"_top\" href=\"index.html#henoch/39/9\">Hen. 39,9</a>; <a class=\"lex-reflink\" data-ref=\"henoch 71:12\" target=\"_top\" href=\"index.html#henoch/71/12\">Hen. 71,12</a>. </span> <span class=\"dl-sense dl-d1\"><b class=\"dl-n\">2</b> <i class=\"dl-tr\">zegenwens</i> <a class=\"lex-reflink\" data-ref=\"genesis 27:12\" target=\"_top\" href=\"index.html#genesis/27/12\">Gen. 27,12</a>; <a class=\"lex-reflink\" data-ref=\"genesis 27:35\" target=\"_top\" href=\"index.html#genesis/27/35\">Gen. 27,35</a>; <a class=\"lex-reflink\" data-ref=\"genesis 27:36\" target=\"_top\" href=\"index.html#genesis/27/36\">Gen. 27,36</a>; <a class=\"lex-reflink\" data-ref=\"genesis 27:38\" target=\"_top\" href=\"index.html#genesis/27/38\">Gen. 27,38</a>; <a class=\"lex-reflink\" data-ref=\"numeri 24:1\" target=\"_top\" href=\"index.html#numeri/24/1\">Num. 24,1</a>; <a class=\"lex-reflink\" data-ref=\"deuteronomium 11:26\" target=\"_top\" href=\"index.html#deuteronomium/11/26\">Deut. 11,26</a>; <a class=